<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African March business confidence index 113.7.</title>
<headline>S.African March business confidence index 113.7.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Chamber of Business said its business confidence index (1990 = 100) rose by 0.5 percentage points to 113.7 points in March from 113.2 points the previous month and 118.0 a year ago.</p>
<p>The March reading was the highest since October last year when it stood at 114.3.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
